#. module: xb_price_checker
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/xb_price_checker/manual.py:0
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the %(block)s block and adjust what you need: %(stock)s says "
"whether that store has it (on by default); %(months)s is on by default and "
"only shows if you have the XPago app; %(back)s is the seconds a product "
"stays on screen (15 by default)."
msgstr ""
"Baja hasta el bloque %(block)s y ajusta lo que quieras: %(stock)s dice si "
"hay o no en esa tienda (viene prendido); %(months)s viene prendido y solo se"
" ve si tienes la app XPago; %(back)s son los segundos que el producto se "
"queda en pantalla (vienen 15)."

#. module: xb_price_checker
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xb_price_checker.field_pos_config__price_checker_idle
