"Turn on Show months without interest, check that you have the XPago app and "
"that a payment rule gives months to that product and price."
msgstr ""
"Prende Mostrar meses sin intereses, revisa que tengas la app XPago y que "
"alguna regla de cobro dé meses a ese producto y precio."

#. module: xb_price_checker
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/xb_price_checker/manual.py:0
msgid "Turn on Show stock and check that the product tracks inventory."
msgstr ""
"Prende Mostrar existencias y revisa que el producto lleve control de "
"inventario."

#. module: xb_price_checker
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/xb_price_checker/manual.py:0
